{
  "_comment": [
    "THE STATE MACHINES, AS DATA.",
    "",
    "Order status, project status, pipeline-instance status and workflow-instance",
    "status are four different questions about four different things, and the",
    "brief is explicit that they must not be merged. An order can be `approved`",
    "while its project is `in_progress` and one of its pipelines is `blocked`.",
    "Collapsing those into one field is how a system starts answering \"how is it",
    "going?\" with \"paid\".",
    "",
    "Transitions are listed rather than inferred. A move that is not listed is",
    "refused by src/operations/status.js — which means adding a state is an edit",
    "to this file, not a hunt through the domain layer for every switch",
    "statement that would have needed a new branch.",
    "",
    "`terminal: true` marks a state nothing leaves. `active: false` marks a state",
    "that is not live work — used to answer \"which projects are running?\"",
    "without a second list somewhere that can disagree with this one.",
    "",
    "Phase 3 adds `task`. It is a fifth machine, not a widening of the other four: a task is where work actually happens, and the states it needs — waiting for input, in review, rejected — describe a piece of work, not a project."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "machines": {
    "order": {
      "initial": "draft",
      "states": {
        "draft": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Draft",
            "ar": "مسودة"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Built but not yet sent to us.",
            "ar": "تم تكوينه ولم يُرسل إلينا بعد."
          },
          "to": [
            "submitted",
            "cancelled"
          ]
        },
        "submitted": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Submitted",
            "ar": "مُرسل"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "The client has sent it. The commercial scope is frozen from here.",
            "ar": "أرسله العميل. النطاق التجاري مُثبَّت من هنا."
          },
          "to": [
            "under_review",
            "cancelled"
          ],
          "freezesScope": true
        },
        "under_review": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Under review",
            "ar": "قيد المراجعة"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "We are reading it and checking we can do it.",
            "ar": "نقرأه ونتأكد أن بإمكاننا تنفيذه."
          },
          "to": [
            "approved",
            "rejected",
            "cancelled"
          ]
        },
        "approved": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Approved",
            "ar": "معتمد"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Accepted. Ready to become a project.",
            "ar": "مقبول. جاهز ليصبح مشروعًا."
          },
          "to": [
            "converted_to_project",
            "cancelled"
          ]
        },
        "rejected": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Rejected",
            "ar": "مرفوض"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "We are not taking it, and the record says why.",
            "ar": "لن ننفذه، والسجل يوضح السبب."
          },
          "to": [],
          "terminal": true
        },
        "converted_to_project": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Converted to project",
            "ar": "حُوِّل إلى مشروع"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "A project exists for it. The order is now history.",
            "ar": "يوجد مشروع مقابل له. الطلب الآن سجل تاريخي."
          },
          "to": [],
          "terminal": true
        },
        "cancelled": {
          "label": {
            "en": "Cancelled",
            "ar": "ملغى"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Withdrawn before it became work.",
            "ar": "سُحب قبل أن يتحول إلى عمل."
          },
          "to": [],
          "terminal": true
        }
      }
    },
    "project": {
